sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Interface: Metrage page
    participant MC as Metrage Controller
    participant MT as SQL table: metrage

    Admin->>UI: Open yardage/metrage page
    Admin->>UI: Select date range

    par Load daily yardage
        UI->>MC: Request daily metrage series
        MC->>MT: Group meters by recorded date
        MT-->>MC: Daily meter totals
        MC-->>UI: Daily series
    and Load period total
        UI->>MC: Request total metrage
        MC->>MT: Sum meters for period
        MT-->>MC: Period total
        MC-->>UI: Total meters
    end

    UI-->>Admin: Display line chart and total value
    alt Invalid range, no data or request error
        UI-->>Admin: Show empty state or error message
    end
